message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: Tripartite TPF Arbitration Model
abstract: >-
  Tripartite game-theoretic Monte Carlo simulation of third-party funding
  agreements in construction arbitration. Seven agreement terms are treated as
  decision variables and evaluated over a synthetic population of construction
  arbitration cases.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Mohy
    given-names: Amr A.
  - family-names: Sanad
    given-names: Haytham M.
keywords:
  - third-party funding
  - construction arbitration
  - game theory
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - global sensitivity analysis
license: MIT
